  "adaptations": [
    "1.63 declaration/registration and whitespace context; production additions retained.",
    "CONTINUATION guard remains after header unpack/type validation, before payload handling; 1.63 continuation counter increments earlier.",
    "Maximum outbound queue option uses original upstream bit 0x040000, distinct from all 1.63 options.",
    "2934 obsolete public-header documentation context excluded; executable changes retained.",
    "2945 removes payload accounting from older 1.63 handlers; two upstream-deleted IGN_ALL guard blocks were already absent in those original handlers. Both complete new receive/send window helper functions and calls retained.",
    "Ordinary upstream tests retain assertions; variable declarations and callback initializer placement adapted to 1.63."
  ],
